{"id":"8220f4203bbba1d2","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full.md","title":"Arithmetical Completeness Full","display":"thm-arithmetical-completeness-full — Arithmetical Completeness Full","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full","aliases":["89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full"],"display":"thm-arithmetical-completeness-full — Arithmetical Completeness Full","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-provability-logic]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arithmetical-completeness-full — Arithmetical Completeness Full"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19a5fceb5d504d9f\" href=\"?note=19a5fceb5d504d9f\" title=\"89-df-provability-logic\">89-df-provability-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c9363f0c1d91236\" href=\"?note=8c9363f0c1d91236\" title=\"89-df-consistent-pa\">89-df-consistent-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"be68cce492414c6b\" href=\"?note=be68cce492414c6b\" title=\"89-thm-solovay-theorem\">89-thm-solovay-theorem</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> holds in the metatheory.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}full}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}completeness\\text{-}full}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GL}=\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 已将“所有实现下 PA 可证”的量化封装为一个公式集</li>\n<li>该等式同时包含算术可靠性与算术完全性</li>\n<li>一致性前提不可省略：若 PA 不一致，则每个算术句都可证，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 会退化为全部模态公式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-logic","status":"resolved","id":"19a5fceb5d504d9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depend